Third-party source datasets
---------------------------

Neither raw source dataset is redistributed here. Only compact derived arrays
and tables are included, sufficient to repeat policy evaluation.

1. Warehouse Science order-picking data (`picks.csv`, `SKUs.csv`), obtained
   from the public Warehouse Science distribution. Derived weekly demand,
   line, order and SKU-master tables in `processed_inputs/` are computed from
   it and remain subject to the original provider's terms.

2. Online Retail II, Chen, D. (2012), UCI Machine Learning Repository,
   https://doi.org/10.24432/C5CG6D. Released under CC BY 4.0. The filtered
   table `processed_inputs/retail2_filtered.parquet` is an adaptation of this
   dataset and is redistributed under the same licence with attribution.
